    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Storm Mined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy. Retry. Understand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a technician piloting a remote-controlled ship, your job is to clear space of mines still being produced by obsolete\u2014yet operational\u2014AIs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 A fast-paced, musical rogue-lite</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One hit is all it takes</strong>: Everyone dies in a single shot \u2013 enemies and you alike. Reflexes, timing, and composure are your only weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each run is unique</strong>: After every level, pick between three upgrades. Triple shot? Shockwaves? Special modules? Shape your playstyle on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm in destruction</strong>: Some levels are synced to the music \u2013 shoot, dodge, and survive to the beat. A sound-driven visual experience with original tracks composed for the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae A modern tribute to arcade classics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Mine Storm</i> (Vectrex, 1982), this remake evolves the original into a full-fledged experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied and unpredictable enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-futuristic visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible yet demanding gameplay</strong>: Can you survive Hard and Nightmare modes?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Storm Mined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy. Retry. Understand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a technician piloting a remote-controlled ship, your job is to clear space of mines still being produced by obsolete\u2014yet operational\u2014AIs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 A fast-paced, musical rogue-lite</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One hit is all it takes</strong>: Everyone dies in a single shot \u2013 enemies and you alike. Reflexes, timing, and composure are your only weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each run is unique</strong>: After every level, pick between three upgrades. Triple shot? Shockwaves? Special modules? Shape your playstyle on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm in destruction</strong>: Some levels are synced to the music \u2013 shoot, dodge, and survive to the beat. A sound-driven visual experience with original tracks composed for the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae A modern tribute to arcade classics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Mine Storm</i> (Vectrex, 1982), this remake evolves the original into a full-fledged experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied and unpredictable enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-futuristic visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible yet demanding gameplay</strong>: Can you survive Hard and Nightmare modes?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Minestorm reimagined with modern gameplay! Blast through waves of deadly mines, gear up with powerful upgrades between levels, and dive into intense rhythm-based stages set to an original soundtrack !",
